The vendored distribution of that work lives in the board/ directory
(see board/LICENSE for the original license text). Modifications made in
this fork (2026-10) include:

  - acceptance-first task schema (tasks.acceptance column and public
    verification API)
  - verification events written into the append-only sha256 hash chain
  - dual SQLite backend: node:sqlite (DatabaseSync) preferred,
    better-sqlite3 fallback, selectable via OCTOBOARD_BACKEND
  - four-layer project partitioning (board / project / task / trace)
  - related bug fixes and packaging changes

